The '''Dome of Deliverance''' was a location in [[Jedha City]],<ref name="UVG" /> a large, walled [[city]] on the<ref name="Galactic Atlas">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref> [[Temperature|cold]], [[desert]] [[moon]]<ref name="Jedha DB">{{Databank|jedha|Jedha}}</ref> of [[Jedha]].<ref name="UVG" /> Before the [[Galactic Empire]] had arrived on Jedha, some of the orphans were brought to live there, or at the [[Temple of the Kyber]] or [[Waiting of Night]].<ref name="GotW">[[Guardians of the Whills (novel)|''Guardians of the Whills'']]</ref> The Dome of Deliverance and the rest of Jedha City were [[Destruction of Jedha City|destroyed]] by a single-[[reactor]] [[superlaser]] blast from the newly-operational [[DS-1 Orbital Battle Station|Death Star]].<ref name="Rogue One">''[[Rogue One: A Star Wars Story]]''</ref>

